# SEND + MORE = MONEY
# Note: this is a very slow solver.

# Assign digits 0-9 to each unique letter
LET s super 1 9   # S cannot be 0
LET e super 0 9
LET n super 0 9
LET d super 0 9
LET m super 1 9   # M cannot be 0
LET o super 0 9
LET r super 0 9
LET y super 0 9

# All letters must represent distinct numbers
PEP 8 s e n d m o r y

# Math constraints using prefix notation
LET send  add mul s 1000 add mul e 100 add mul n 10 d
LET more  add mul m 1000 add mul o 100 add mul r 10 e
LET money add mul m 10000 add mul o 1000 add mul n 100 add mul e 10 y

# Constraint: SEND + MORE must equal MONEY
CHK eq add send more money

# Observe the unique solution
OBS s
OBS e
OBS n
OBS d
OBS m
OBS o
OBS r
OBS y